# Copy this file to .github-token and paste your GitHub Personal Access Token
# 
# 1. Create a token: https://github.com/settings/tokens
#    - Classic token, scope: repo (full control)
# 2. cp .github-token.example .github-token
# 3. Paste your token as the only line in .github-token (no quotes)
#
# .github-token is in .gitignore and will never be committed.
